<report>
<title>Paired t test</title>

<p>For @label:<br />
Mean of differences = @{mean:roundu}  (n = @n)<br />
Standard deviation = @{sd:roundu}<br />
Standard error = @{sem:roundu}</p>

<p><ci>@{pc:round2}% CI = @{from:roundu} to @{to:roundu}</ci></p>

<p>df =  @df<br />
t = @{t:roundu}</p>

<p><pval>One sided @{tail_1:pval}</pval><br />
<pval>Two sided @{tail_2:pval}</pval></p>

<p>Power @pwr</p>
<block name="twosample">
<br />
<br />
<title>Two sample analysis of agreement</title>

<p>@{pc:round2}% Limits of agreement = @{from2:roundu} to @{to2:roundu}  @note</p>
</block>
</report>
